# Design-file inputs. `build-design-shots.mjs` turns these into the served
# files in public/images; the sources themselves are 40 MB of full-size
# photography and are not worth carrying in the repository. The README beside
# them says where they come from and how to get them back.
assets/design-shots/*
!assets/design-shots/README.md
assets/design-scenes/*
